    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Non-native settlement in Jordan Valley was largely driven by the discovery of gold along Jordan Creek in 1863.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jordan_Valley%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Jordan Valley takes its name from Michael Jordan, a nineteenth-century prospector who explored the local creek.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jordan_Valley%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A historic pelota court, known as the Pelota Fronton, was built in 1915 to serve the town's Basque community.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
